OL,3,GNEWSARural safety scheme appeals for
OL,4,Aadvice from women
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team will start widening and
OL,7,Fresurfacing the route, alongside Durham
OL,8,FCounty Council, in the winter. However,
OL,9,Fthe charity said it was also looking to
OL,10,Fmake sure the path was made more
OL,11,Faccessible to women, especially during
OL,12,Fdarker evenings.
